00:28:38.642 --> 00:28:40.010
BRIAN GRANATIR: [LAUGHS]
I blather on, man.

00:28:40.010 --> 00:28:40.615
[LAUGHS]

00:28:40.615 --> 00:28:41.190
MARK MANDEL: It's all right.

00:28:41.190 --> 00:28:41.815
You're excited.

00:28:41.815 --> 00:28:42.380
I love it.

00:28:42.380 --> 00:28:43.254
So you have the data.

00:28:43.254 --> 00:28:44.074
It's in Datastore.

00:28:44.074 --> 00:28:45.740
Analytics, like
obviously, then, you're,

00:28:45.740 --> 00:28:46.580
talking about machine learning.

00:28:46.580 --> 00:28:47.940
You're doing all
that kind of stuff.

00:28:47.940 --> 00:28:49.856
Are you doing that
directly through Datastore?

